WEBVTT

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:05.270
I wonder what it will be?

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.610
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:11.120
It's a monster in the Blackwing series!

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.760
It can gather the power of 
Blackwings on the field.

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:34.460
There's good stuff here.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:42.330
We've received information that a 
mysterious D-Wheel is parked at A2 block.

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:45.260
Roger.  We're heading to that location.

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:53.900
This must be it.  I've never 
seen this type before.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:56.340
Why is it parked in a place like this?

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:59.230
I can also use this.

00:00:59.390 --> 00:01:03.410
Leaving it here would be a waste.

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.040
What?

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.400
What is this?

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:14.420
Let's tow it away.

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:21.600
I'll take this too.

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:39.660
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:44.760
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:49.670
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:54.440
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:59.810
No matter how bad today is

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:04.790
There’s still the faintest light

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:10.190
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:14.260
Is light it myself

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:19.260
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:24.230
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:30.530
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:34.510
Today will never exist again

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:40.410
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:09.770
My Name is Crow!
Fly, Blackbird

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:16.750
I want to ask you one thing.

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:21.380
Yusei, why do you ride a D-Wheel?

00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:24.200
I'm not required to answer you.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:30.210
This bridge was supposed to 
link the City with Satellite.

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:39.160
You built your own D-Wheel and crossed this 
ocean.  I sense great destiny for you.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:44.750
The person who links this 
bridge someday might be you.

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:48.920
With your political power, 
you can complete this bridge.

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:50.510
I can't.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:51.710
Why not?

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:56.630
Because that will cause Satellite's 
catastrophe to come into the City.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:58.540
Satellite's catastrophe?

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:03.510
The time has come for me 
to tell you the truth.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:07.740
Alright, alright.  Just a little more.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:14.200
As expected, they brought it for me.

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:20.160
With this much baggage, I can't 
use the street that I came in.

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:28.820
Oh well.

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:30.310
Here I go!

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:34.240
What is it?

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:35.650
It's the corridor in the storage area!

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:37.970
There's nothing on the security cameras!

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:39.560
I'll change the channel.

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:43.760
It's a fake screen!  Emergency!  
Someone broke into the storage area!

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:48.070
All workers, capture him!  I repeat, 
someone broke into the storage area!

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:48.310
He's over here!

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:49.450
Freeze!

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:52.640
You won't capture Crow!

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:01.470
Blackbird!

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:12.500
Thanks for bringing this over 
here.  I need it to escape!

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:14.940
Hurry up and close it!

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.210
Don't let him escape!  
Hurry up and open the gate!

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:34.110
Don't underestimate its abilities!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.540
I can't catch up!

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:41.550
If we fail, I can't imagine 
what Ushio will say to us!

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:44.580
Therefore, I force Speed World to activate!

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:56.090
Duel Mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:05:58.330 --> 00:05:59.500
So you want to fight.

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:03.940
If I'm in a Riding Duel, my 
speed is required to decrease.

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:07.310
That's the only way he can catch up to me.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:08.830
Duel!

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:11.350
My turn!

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:14.250
I summon Gate Blocker in defense position!

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:19.670
Then I set three cards and end my turn!

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:21.400
It's my turn!

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:25.920
What?  My Speed Counters don't increase?

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:34.190
Too bad!  When Gate Blocker is on the 
field, you can't gain Speed Counters!

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:36.900
I see.  That's an annoying card.

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:41.130
Don't underestimate me, thief!  
These three set cards…

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:48.600
The first card is Sakuretsu Armor.  It 
destroys your monster when it attacks!

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:53.860
The next card is Dust Tornado.  It 
destroys your trap and spell cards!

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:58.220
The final card is Intercept.  
When you release a

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:02.550
monster to summon a high-Level 
monster, I gain control of it!

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:06.010
With these three cards, your 
monsters can't attack, you

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:09.010
can't activate traps and you can't 
summon a high-Level monster!

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:13.270
All your actions are blocked!  
I won't let you escape!

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:18.100
I Special Summon Blackwing 
- Sirocco the Dawn!

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:27.220
I can Special Summon this card from my hand 
when only you have monsters on the field.

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:31.480
Then I Special Summon Blackwing 
- Gale the Whirlwind!

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:37.800
I can Special Summon this card from my 
hand when I have a Blackwing on my field.

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:43.330
Then I summon Blackwing - Bora the Spear!

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:50.080
He instantly summoned three monsters.

00:07:50.460 --> 00:07:52.700
However, you don't have 
any monsters on your field

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:55.190
that are stronger than Gate 
Blocker's defense points!

00:07:56.170 --> 00:08:00.800
Your Security Deck is nothing 
but a lame Rock Deck.

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:03.830
It's not good enough to evade my attack!

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:06.360
I activate Gale the 
Whirlwind's monster effect!

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:13.720
One of your monster's 
defense points are halved!

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:19.640
Then from my hand, I activate the 
trap card Delta Crow - Anti Reverse!

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:20.630
From your hand?

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:22.120
He can activate a trap from his hand?

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:28.790
I can activate this trap from my hand when 
I have three or more Blackwings on my field!

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:32.720
All set cards on your field are destroyed!

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:33.470
What?

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:40.780
Next, I activate Sirocco 
the Dawn's monster effect!

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.990
I select one Blackwing on my field.

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:46.470
The non-selected monsters 
can't attack, but their attack

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:49.470
points are added to the selected 
monster's attack points!

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:56.280
Bora the Spear powers up by gaining the 
strengths of Sirocco the Dawn and Gale the Whirlwind!

00:08:57.630 --> 00:08:59.250
5000 attack points?

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:02.390
Then Bora the Spear's 
monster effect activates!

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:05.700
When this attacks a monster in defense 
position, if its attack points are

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:09.700
greater than your monster's defense points, 
the difference is dealt to you as damage!

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:17.120
Take this!  Black Spiral!

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.280
That punk!  I won't let you escape!

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:36.580
There's a cliff up ahead!  
There's no way to escape!

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:43.650
What's he doing?

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:45.270
He's still going!

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:09.040
Let's go, Blackbird!

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:11.160
Formation change.

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:18.580
Fly!

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:26.230
He flew!

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:34.130
What should we do?

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:39.660
What can we do?  The area ahead is outside our 
jurisdiction.  That area is dangerous, even for us!

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:41.040
You're right.

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:45.640
When Ushio returns, he'll be shocked.

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:01.590
What's going on?

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:03.580
That's what I want to ask.

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:07.570
I came to pick up the King.

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:10.870
That's right.  You fought against the King.

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:12.680
What?

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.510
Look at this!

00:11:18.390 --> 00:11:19.720
Impossible.

00:11:20.090 --> 00:11:24.510
Our priority is to find 
this woman and the King.

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:28.570
Hey!  That security camera 
footage is evidence!

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:34.530
Are you an idiot?  If someone sees this 
footage, it's the end for you and the King!

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:37.240
Understood.

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:52.310
Crow!

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:53.450
It's Crow!

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:55.610
Welcome home, Crow!

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:56.800
Welcome home!

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.120
Did you all behave?

00:11:59.120 --> 00:11:59.970
Yeah!

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:01.750
Then I have gifts.

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:04.170
Ta-daa!

00:12:05.340 --> 00:12:06.990
Hooray!  Awesome!

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:08.470
We can really have them?

00:12:08.850 --> 00:12:13.580
Yeah.  The cards are happier being with you.

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:18.740
But remember, don't do anything bad 
that attracts Security's attention.

00:12:18.740 --> 00:12:21.930
Or else, you'll have a face like mine!

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:26.440
If you listen to what I say, I promise that 
I'll someday take you away from this place!

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:27.850
Right!

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.100
We have breaking news.

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:39.310
His name is Yusei Fudo!  It's 
the birth of a new King!

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:41.650
Yusei actually succeeded.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:46.380
That means the City duelists 
aren't very skilled.

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:52.890
Is this the truth you're talking about?

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:59.350
That's right.  The legend of the Crimson 
Dragon is five thousand years old.

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:02.990
You're expecting me to 
believe that occult tale?

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:10.490
Many unbelievable destinies 
exist in this world, Yusei.

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:17.640
You met duelists with strange powers, 
didn't you?  The Dark Signers.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.980
You know about the Dark Signers?

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:22.140
The man with the spider mark!

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.950
They are the enemies of the Signers.

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:32.120
After five thousand years, their 
evil souls have resurrected.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:37.280
When the gates to the 
underworld open, the Signers

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:41.280
and the Dark Signers will battle 
with the world at stake.

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:43.930
The world at stake?

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:48.470
Ever since the creation 
of the world, Signers and

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:52.470
Dark Signers have battled 
every five thousand years.

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:56.360
In the battle five thousand years ago, the People

00:13:56.360 --> 00:14:00.360
of the Stars used the power of the five dragons that

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:03.700
served the Crimson Dragon to seal the evil god in

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:07.990
the land of Nazca and close the gate to the underworld.

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:29.250
Afterwards, the Crimson Dragon was separated 
into five pieces and sealed away in the human world.

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:39.240
This is that seal and the mark on the 
Dark Signer's arm was Nazca lines.

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:45.230
Why is the battle between the Signers 
and Dark Signers happening again now?

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:51.540
You know about Moment that's located 
underground below Kaiba Corporation.

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:56.280
It's a dream machine that continually 
creates positive energy.

00:15:56.280 --> 00:16:04.880
But long before its creation, the first version 
of Moment was in the deepest area under Satellite.

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:11.100
Seventeen years ago, the Moment 
Investigation and Development Section, also known as

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:17.100
MIDS, turned on the first version of Moment 
when its control system was still incomplete.

00:16:18.540 --> 00:16:21.990
They did so because they believed the 
City's prosperity was more important.

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:28.180
Then a tragedy occurred.

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:35.530
Moment was supposed to have position 
spin, but it began having negative spin.

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:53.070
At the same time, Nazca 
emitted incredible energy.

00:16:54.140 --> 00:17:00.310
It emitted the same amount 
of energy as Moment.

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:06.820
When the Dark Signers appear, the gates 
to the underworld will also open.

00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:13.490
After five thousand years, the seal 
on the Dark Signers have weakened.

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:18.120
The old Moment began reacting 
with the gates to the underworld.

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:24.600
I confirmed that the five thousand year-old 
battle was going to take place here once again.

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:29.470
In order to close the gates 
to the underworld, the Dark

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:32.470
Signers must be defeated because 
they're guarding the gates.

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:39.780
That's why I created the Fortune Cup in 
order to awaken the power of the Signers.

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:44.040
What happens if we lose the 
battle against the Dark Signers?

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:48.510
The world will change.  It will 
be a world of the afterlife.

00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:51.200
It's a world we know as Hell.

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:54.430
That's the vision I saw.

00:17:55.650 --> 00:18:00.010
If the battle is going to take place at 
Satellite, then evacuate the citizens immediately!

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:01.630
I can't do that.

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:07.100
If there's no one in Satellite, they'll 
change the battle venue to the

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:12.590
City in order to find new sacrifices.  
That will get even more people involved.

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:16.440
You knew about that and 
still created Satellite?

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:20.560
You don't care if the citizens 
of Satellite are sacrificed!

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:26.040
Do you want to save Satellite, Yusei?

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:29.570
Then stop the Dark Signers!

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:32.340
Stop them with the power of the Signers!

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:34.040
With our power?

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:35.980
Wait!

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:38.420
You said there were five Signers.

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:41.680
There's one person missing!

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:44.730
I guarantee that the person 
will eventually show up.

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:46.180
I guarantee it.

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.620
That's destiny!

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:12.420
After five thousand years, humanity has once 
again created a tower for foolish rituals.

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:15.750
This time, we will become 
the rulers of the world!

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:30.500
I…

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:32.390
It's my and…

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:34.280
And my…

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:36.000
Turn!

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.420
I remember.

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:46.930
My fortune…  Draw!

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:48.630
I'm coming!

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:50.780
Yes?

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:52.990
Who are you?

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:54.270
Excuse me.

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:56.630
Sorry about what happened before.

00:19:56.820 --> 00:19:59.370
We're from the Public Maintenance Department.

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:04.980
We know who are you are ...and we 
know that you kidnapped Master Atlas!

00:20:06.070 --> 00:20:11.040
Give Master Atlas back to us.  
He still needs medical attention.

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:13.220
It's not that girl's fault.

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:14.950
I asked for her help.

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:16.460
Master Atlas…

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:20.160
So you were here.  Let's go back.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:22.500
Where can I go back to?

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:24.780
Besides, I'm no longer the King.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:26.540
Master Atlas…

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:31.190
I'll stay here.  You guys leave!

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:32.040
But…

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:34.330
Enough!  Don't order me around!

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:36.060
You don't know me anyway!

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:39.060
Don't bother me!  I'm staying here!

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:46.770
What's with this turn of events?  
Is she Jack's girlfriend?

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:51.390
Am I involved in this?  
Am I in a love triangle?

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:56.180
Understood, Master Atlas.  
I'll leave for today.

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:03.940
Umm, I'm leaving too!

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:05.880
Please wait, Mikage!

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:11.310
I don't understand what's going 
on, but I feel like I totally won!

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:16.990
Leave me alone.

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:17.460
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:22.530
We will build our own future

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:27.970
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:28.440 --> 00:22:33.150
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:48.290
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:53.860
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:53.930 --> 00:22:58.570
Even if it loses its light

00:22:59.030 --> 00:23:03.840
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:23:03.840 --> 00:23:08.310
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:23:08.510 --> 00:23:13.890
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:18.750
This journey has no end

00:23:18.990 --> 00:23:24.230
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:29.470
Hear my voice
